{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "173970ac7ece1847f1de4a28eb33c9e2c52b29b73c3b00b856d8149853de6c1b", "ja": "旋律の†五重奏†", "zh": "旋律†五重奏†", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e82c8ca769f67be7be8b3bbf0d7b0116b5083969063e563cc1770c4937c5b634", "ja": "いよいよ公演初日。昴は小説を最後まで読ん\nだと言い、熱く感想を語り出す。百合子は動\n揺しながらも、読んでくれたお礼を返す。メ\nンバー達は、世界観に合わせた掛け声で気合\nいを入れ、終焉の時が満ちるのだった。", "zh": "终于到了公演首日。昴说自己看完了小说，\n激动地分享起感想。百合子虽然感到震惊，\n但还是很感谢昴将自己的作品看完。\n成员们用这个世界观的口号为彼此打气，\n终结的时机已经来临。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1e8fbd61b1ab773c86a6d294151cd76ba6aab28e7a122e47a5b23f9ba04aff3d", "ja": "（全員が世界観を掴んでからのレッスンは順調に進み、\nいよいよ新ユニットの公演初日を迎えた！）", "zh": "（所有人都理解世界观之后，练习进行得相当顺利，\n终于迎来了新团体的公演首日！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "4f8c1fa2a7cdc77adbff6a196b4fc13b0cdf65ce43f60cc5eb0e83014e315c3a", "ja": "ふわぁ……。\nうう、眠いぜ……。", "zh": "呼哇……\n呜呜，好困喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7069dce42da6ddb0e7f53719536524f9fe94894df2ce13aa150b535256fc5124", "ja": "あれ？\nどうしたんだ昴、寝不足か？", "zh": "咦？昴你怎么了？\n没睡饱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "2a881fa4d5e8b6d8a0b68186fa2bbbcc6e3e45a86fa4e8bbab49f9a80ad97514", "ja": "あ、うん。昨日の夜、やっと小説読み終わったんだ。\n百合子の書いたやつ。", "zh": "啊，嗯。\n我昨天晚上，终于把百合子写的小说看完了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "c4fcfb819e23691b9e3892d6f3390693970d7ed780b2ba2c3037888f432f3a77", "ja": "ええっ！？　な、なんで公演初日に言うんですかっ！？\n動揺を誘う作戦ですか！？", "zh": "咦咦！？为、为什么要挑公演第一天说这个！？\n你是想害我心慌吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "0bf0e79b6c4a6ba01155e6f0a07f44b163c4dc8ea7862dac848bf90d2ef2ed9a", "ja": "え？\nだって、昨日読み終わったから……。", "zh": "咦？\n因为我就是在昨天看完了嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "3aefc3e12897dff23e2a8f976c455f3547bbcaa46c796b30ebd43297da141fda", "ja": "まぁとにかく、百合子がいろいろ考えて\n書いたの、わかったからかな？　最後まで読めたよ！", "zh": "总而言之，大概是因为我了解了这是百合子\n经过重重思考才写出来的，所以才能看完它吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "8110f8d226ea1bbf5d89d82e4b97d45d98d71c222453edc2e19ce21eb857fd7c", "ja": "昴さん……。", "zh": "昴……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "349dde8967966150a3402a487f05eb0218980d139943c4f1da1560c0a4a9d867", "ja": "最後、堕天使と決着をつけるところとか、\nなんかすっげー盛り上がったし！", "zh": "最后跟堕天使对决的场景，\n感觉也超级精彩的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d8efba1bf7a83148a98f872702b028a6f469ebeeabff524adcbb044a4f4eec16", "ja": "ああ、そこはカッコ良かったな。\nビジュアルイメージの参考にも……。", "zh": "啊啊，那里确实很帅呢。\n也可以当成视觉设计的参考……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "f9511c730769d351e27315112bc139cd8e974be26de6b3a984f06419822e37da", "ja": "あ、あああのっ！\nシーンごとの感想はやめてもらっていいですか！？", "zh": "那、那那那个！\n可以不要每幕都说出自己的感想吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "83d340a4ccd4bdbdcecf2c84b45e39239b3882246d898d160bd9d50ae71925e9", "ja": "えっ？　なんで？", "zh": "咦？为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "79836bf6a3d35e0f2a10b96291b2aa1e6cae7b30df3df864f0cf895a3d55f282", "ja": "なんでというか、それは公開処刑のようなもので……\nと、とにかく慈悲だと思って、やめてください！", "zh": "还问为什么，这感觉就像在大庭广众下出糗一样啊……\n总、总之你就当作是可怜我，别再说下去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "cf25278f1b23dceed4ba9672a96405a4430f47a87985fc898cc57fabf6cb1ec8", "ja": "ふーん、そうなのか？\nほめてるのに、へんなの。", "zh": "喔～是喔？\n我明明是在夸你的说，真奇怪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "500d97372bf2c6ded30c0f87be15d5791a3c8f2dbf697b1b4d1d4934ca59df8b", "ja": "あっ！　でもその、うれしくないとかじゃなくて！\nありがとうございます、昴さん。読んでくれて……。", "zh": "啊！但我没有觉得不开心喔！\n昴，真的很谢谢你把它看完……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1015_p", "source_sha256": "87b5c6beb21b697d32c20b73574e6d879daef26e1464d59e906a85ef806cb80b", "ja": "さあ……そろそろ出番だ。\nみんな、準備は大丈夫か？", "zh": "好……该上场了。\n你们准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "e8001b2f4288cb2151e5547a245f4158cec0776eb28dd9d85e58bfe00b6c804a", "ja": "うん……杏奈は、大丈夫……だよ。\nステータス……オール、グリーン……。", "zh": "嗯……杏奈……准备好了。\n状态……绝佳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "f65c4f7c3fa75a4c1ce14f16a22884be4438959648d0666e64bff294f7f1a8e6", "ja": "世界観、設定、雰囲気……すべて把握しました。\nばっちりだぞ。", "zh": "世界观、设定、氛围……\n我全都清楚了，准备万全喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1018_025roc", "source_sha256": "92bec65e10c48fb6ce74887d762349a1232441b83725529e431e2b8e61ec30a5", "ja": "あとはステージの上で、ロコ達のアートを\nエクスプレッションするだけですね！", "zh": "接下来只须站上Stage，将ROCO我们的Art\nExpression出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "0955337d0a35a503a48347121272e34f8bf3563321dc91427792c8212f6a209f", "ja": "なあ、みんな！　いつもみたいに円陣組んで、\nフツーに気合い入れるのもいいんだけどさ。", "zh": "我说大家！虽然像平时那样\n围一圈喊口号也是不错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "13d6a81fe2dce321f2e1a63463a69783648ba613a15e4036f52d5e6f136f712a", "ja": "今日は世界観にあわせて、ゴシックロリータっての？\nそれっぽくやってみないか？", "zh": "但我们今天要不要配合这个世界观，\n喊出歌德风萝莉塔的味道试试？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1021_024ann", "source_sha256": "2dd461c495df87d4c505c0a0fcd9d443b751a0ec8e96be2ad5674bcc462ecf84", "ja": "世界観にあわせた……気合い……？\nあっ……うん、わかった……。", "zh": "配合世界观……喊口号打气……？\n啊……嗯，杏奈知道了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1022_024ann", "source_sha256": "b3388cf2c64c5c2c2189e87e0b174d50f9c1d819e2dbe4831feefaabf8243bd7", "ja": "えっと……\n悠久を……永遠を……彷徨ってきた……。", "zh": "呃……\n在漫长……永恒之时……无限彷徨……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "1dfe9a2fe6bc17c36d4e9b4aae330cf9a1e62d1b6a5b793048d53e82db371867", "ja": "なるほど。では私も。\n……それは封じられた記憶。偽りの姿。", "zh": "原来如此，那我也来。\n……其为被封印的记忆，乃虚假之姿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1024_025roc", "source_sha256": "894a86c757bcfebd6f886ebcb97535e49120deecf4e8ed86d5adb17449365c47", "ja": "ラジャーですよ！\n……歪んでいく景色と、手の中に残る感触。", "zh": "Roger！\n……逐渐扭曲的景色与残留在手中的触感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1025_026yur", "source_sha256": "65142e23969ca64cae1cb572a4bfa85cd4464c1ab5d06f9159236503df5b07f5", "ja": "はい！　……真実を知るまでは、安寧に微睡む。\nけど、知ってしまえば……。", "zh": "是！\n……在知晓真相之前，安详酣睡。然而一旦发觉之后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1026_047sub", "source_sha256": "7fd0cecad360f504899dc296bc2a8c2a88a61fe616a220f1abdb4e08cf9be08a", "ja": "ええと、オレ……じゃなかった。私たちは、背く！\nそして逆光の運命を、不可逆の縛鎖を砕く！", "zh": "呃，我……不对，我们会起身反抗！\n然后终结逆光的命运、摧毁不可逆的枷锁！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_06_1027_p", "source_sha256": "6d64266076aa0151fa94b824200850beb42e05cb4ca11c22ef73279df3ff9e49", "ja": "（みんな、息もピッタリだ。終焉の刻は満ちた……\nステージという運命を相手に、舞い踊ってくれ！）", "zh": "（大家默契十足。终结的时机已经来临……\n将名为舞台的命运视作舞伴，一起舞动吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
